WEBVTT

00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:23.347
This story takes place in Spanish, California during the first part of the 1800s.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:37.353
The word Zorro means Fox in Spanish.

00:00:37.413 --> 00:00:51.130
The story of Zorro is an old legend from Spanish, California.

00:00:51.190 --> 00:01:03.528
Chapter 1 A Stormy Night Reina de Los Angeles is a Spanish village in Southern California.

00:01:03.588 --> 00:01:10.404
In the village, there is a military procedure with Spanish soldiers and their horses.

00:01:10.464 --> 00:01:14.746
There is also a Spanish church called a mission.

00:01:14.806 --> 00:01:18.007
The Spanish friars live here.

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:24.672
All around the village there are big homes with patios.

00:01:24.732 --> 00:01:33.628
Tonight there is a terrible storm and it is raining.

00:01:33.688 --> 00:01:40.924
Inside the village tavern there are soldiers and other men.

00:01:40.984 --> 00:01:44.350
They are eating and drinking.

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:49.438
Sergeant Pedro Gonzales is at the tavern.

00:01:49.498 --> 00:01:52.750
He is a big, strong man.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:55.122
What a horrible night.

00:01:55.182 --> 00:01:57.964
It always rains in February.

00:01:58.024 --> 00:02:00.956
Where is Zorro on this stormy night?

00:02:01.016 --> 00:02:02.937
Asks one soldier.

00:02:02.997 --> 00:02:06.310
Zorro, don't say that name.

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:09.502
He is a bandit and a criminal.

00:02:09.562 --> 00:02:11.832
Says Sergeant Gonzales.

00:02:11.891 --> 00:02:17.021
He is the terror of Southern California, says another soldier.

00:02:17.081 --> 00:02:21.282
People say that he takes from the rich and gives to the poor.

00:02:21.342 --> 00:02:24.873
He is a friend of the natives and the friars.

00:02:24.933 --> 00:02:28.904
He punishes dishonest people, says an old man.

00:02:28.924 --> 00:02:33.275
Oh, Zorro is a big mystery.

00:02:33.335 --> 00:02:34.366
Who is he?

00:02:34.426 --> 00:02:36.143
Where is he from?

00:02:36.203 --> 00:02:40.432
He wears a black mask, and no one can see his face.

00:02:40.492 --> 00:02:45.214
He travels on the El Camino Real, on his fast horse.

00:02:45.274 --> 00:02:47.866
He is very good with his sword.

00:02:47.926 --> 00:02:49.256
Says the Sergeant.

00:02:49.316 --> 00:02:54.468
Yes, and he leaves his mark, the Z, everywhere.

00:02:54.528 --> 00:02:56.820
Says the old man.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.281
No one can stop him.

00:02:59.341 --> 00:03:04.303
The governor of California offers a big reward for the capture of Zorro.

00:03:04.363 --> 00:03:06.974
Says one soldier.

00:03:07.034 --> 00:03:10.694
At that moment, a man enters the tavern.

00:03:10.754 --> 00:03:12.666
He is young and handsome.

00:03:12.726 --> 00:03:16.078
He has black hair and dark eyes.

00:03:16.138 --> 00:03:18.300
He has fine clothes.

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:22.333
Don Diego Vega, my friend.

00:03:22.393 --> 00:03:24.304
Says Sergeant Gonzales.

00:03:24.364 --> 00:03:26.216
Your clothes are wet.

00:03:26.276 --> 00:03:29.998
Why are you out on this rainy night?

00:03:30.058 --> 00:03:36.062
Don Diego smiles and says, I am going home, but I am cold and wet.

00:03:36.122 --> 00:03:38.378
I want something to drink.

00:03:38.438 --> 00:03:42.402
Come and stand near the fire, says the Sergeant.

00:03:42.462 --> 00:03:44.593
Here is a glass of wine.

00:03:44.653 --> 00:03:47.654
Thank you, my friend, says Don Diego.

00:03:47.714 --> 00:03:50.166
We are talking about Zorro.

00:03:50.226 --> 00:03:53.617
Everyone is scared of him, but I am not.

00:03:53.677 --> 00:03:56.739
I am ready to fight Zorro and win.

00:03:56.798 --> 00:03:59.270
I am a champion with the sword.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.460
What do you think, Don Diego?

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:03.050
Ask the Sergeant.

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.981
Everyone talks about this mysterious man with a mask.

00:04:07.041 --> 00:04:09.331
Many people say good things about him.

00:04:09.391 --> 00:04:10.671
Says Don Diego.

00:04:10.731 --> 00:04:13.712
I want to fight him and capture him.

00:04:13.772 --> 00:04:15.852
I want the big reward.

00:04:15.912 --> 00:04:17.603
Says Sergeant Gonzales.

00:04:17.663 --> 00:04:18.773
No, no.

00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:20.653
Don't talk about fighting.

00:04:20.713 --> 00:04:23.444
I hate fighting and I hate violence.

00:04:23.504 --> 00:04:25.514
I think Zorro is sincere.

00:04:25.574 --> 00:04:27.895
He punishes only bad people.

00:04:27.955 --> 00:04:29.525
He protects the poor.

00:04:29.585 --> 00:04:35.558
The natives and the friars let Zorro do his work, says Don Diego.

00:04:35.618 --> 00:04:40.480
You are a kind man, you like music and poetry.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:43.021
You don't understand, my friend.

00:04:43.081 --> 00:04:46.632
You are rich and noble, says the sergeant.

00:04:46.692 --> 00:04:50.214
Don Diego smiles and says, it's 6 p.m.

00:04:50.274 --> 00:04:52.155
I must return to my Hacienda.

00:04:52.215 --> 00:04:53.826
Good night, everyone.

00:04:53.886 --> 00:05:02.528
He opens the tavern door and goes out into the rain.

00:05:02.588 --> 00:05:10.173
Chapter 2, a surprise visit.

00:05:10.233 --> 00:05:15.658
At 7 p.m., the door of the tavern opens.

00:05:15.718 --> 00:05:21.975
Sergeant Gonzales and the other soldiers are standing near the fire.

00:05:22.034 --> 00:05:27.976
They are talking about Don Diego Vega and his rich family.

00:05:28.035 --> 00:05:31.572
They turn around and see a man.

00:05:31.632 --> 00:05:34.213
He is dressed in black.

00:05:34.273 --> 00:05:38.324
He has a black mask and a black sombrero.

00:05:38.384 --> 00:05:40.124
It is Zorro.

00:05:40.184 --> 00:05:41.515
Good evening.

00:05:41.575 --> 00:05:43.015
My name is Zorro.

00:05:43.075 --> 00:05:45.096
Says the masked man.

00:05:45.156 --> 00:05:50.126
The men in the tavern are very surprised and scared.

00:05:50.186 --> 00:05:57.562
Sergeant Gonzales looks at him carefully and says, What do you want, Bandit?

00:05:57.622 --> 00:06:00.097
Zorro laughs loudly.

00:06:00.157 --> 00:06:05.909
He looks at Sergeant Gonzales and says, I am here to punish you, Sergeant.

00:06:05.969 --> 00:06:07.759
What do you mean?

00:06:07.819 --> 00:06:09.070
Says the Sergeant.

00:06:09.129 --> 00:06:11.150
You beat the poor natives.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.940
I'm a friend of the natives.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.871
I'm here to punish you.

00:06:14.931 --> 00:06:16.461
You idiot.

00:06:16.521 --> 00:06:19.492
The governor wants you dead or alive.

00:06:19.552 --> 00:06:21.432
Says Sergeant Gonzales.

00:06:21.492 --> 00:06:24.748
He pulls out his sword and wants to fight.

00:06:24.808 --> 00:06:28.466
At that moment, Zorro pulls out a pistol.

00:06:28.525 --> 00:06:31.399
He watches everyone carefully.

00:06:31.459 --> 00:06:38.326
Sergeant Gonzales looks at the pistol and says, courageous men don't use pistols.

00:06:38.386 --> 00:06:40.018
They use swords.

00:06:40.078 --> 00:06:43.413
Perhaps you are not courageous, Zorro.

00:06:43.473 --> 00:06:48.047
This pistol is necessary because you have many friends in this tavern.

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:50.769
Everyone must go near the fire and stay there.

00:06:50.829 --> 00:06:51.750
Says Zorro.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:55.302
Now I have a pistol in my left hand and a sword in my right hand.

00:06:55.362 --> 00:06:57.184
I am ready to punish you.

00:06:57.244 --> 00:06:58.445
Fight, Senor!

00:06:58.505 --> 00:07:00.367
Says the Sergeant.

00:07:00.426 --> 00:07:02.728
They start fighting.

00:07:02.788 --> 00:07:06.743
Their swords move quickly and make a lot of noise.

00:07:06.803 --> 00:07:09.456
The two men are good fighters.

00:07:09.516 --> 00:07:12.499
Zorro is fast and light.

00:07:12.559 --> 00:07:15.992
Sergeant Gonzalez is slow and heavy.

00:07:16.052 --> 00:07:18.774
Zorro jumps onto a table.

00:07:18.834 --> 00:07:21.116
Then he jumps onto a chair.

00:07:21.176 --> 00:07:27.190
The fight continues and Sergeant Gonzalez's sword falls onto the floor.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.042
His face is white.

00:07:29.102 --> 00:07:30.713
He is scared.

00:07:30.772 --> 00:07:36.508
Zorro slaps his face and says, This is your punishment.

00:07:36.568 --> 00:07:42.535
Then he makes a zine on the sergeant's shirt with his sword.

00:07:42.594 --> 00:07:45.377
Zorro runs to the window.

00:07:45.437 --> 00:07:50.401
He opens it and says, Good evening, gentlemen.

00:07:50.461 --> 00:07:55.976
He jumps out of the window and disappears.

00:07:56.036 --> 00:08:06.327
Chapter 3 The Pulido Hacienda The next day is warm and sunny.

00:08:06.387 --> 00:08:10.082
Don Diego gets on his beautiful horse.

00:08:10.142 --> 00:08:15.494
He rides to Don Carlos Pulidos Big Hacienda.

00:08:15.554 --> 00:08:20.228
Don Carlos is a good friend of Don Diego's family.

00:08:20.288 --> 00:08:23.699
Both families are rich and important.

00:08:23.759 --> 00:08:27.321
But the governor does not like Don Carlos.

00:08:27.381 --> 00:08:29.742
He creates problems for him.

00:08:29.802 --> 00:08:33.024
He wants to take Don Carlos' land.

00:08:33.084 --> 00:08:36.185
Don Carlos is happy to see his friend.

00:08:36.245 --> 00:08:38.096
Good morning, Don Diego.

00:08:38.156 --> 00:08:39.830
What a nice surprise.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:41.802
Come and sit in the patio.

00:08:41.862 --> 00:08:43.024
Thank you.

00:08:43.085 --> 00:08:47.188
I'm here to say something very important, says Don Diego.

00:08:47.248 --> 00:08:49.839
I am almost 25 years old.

00:08:49.898 --> 00:08:53.362
My father wants me to get married and start a family.

00:08:53.422 --> 00:08:55.774
I am not interested in marriage.

00:08:55.834 --> 00:09:00.338
I think love and marriage are boring, but I must obey my father.

00:09:00.398 --> 00:09:02.650
How old is your daughter Lolita?

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.362
Ask Stondiego.

00:09:04.422 --> 00:09:08.486
Lolita is 18 years old, and she is very beautiful.

00:09:08.546 --> 00:09:10.279
Answers don't catalyst.

00:09:10.339 --> 00:09:12.182
You have a fine family.

00:09:12.242 --> 00:09:15.693
With your permission, I want to marry your daughter.

00:09:15.753 --> 00:09:17.364
Says Don Diego.

00:09:17.424 --> 00:09:20.065
Don Carlos smiles and is happy.

00:09:20.125 --> 00:09:22.606
This is an honor for our family.

00:09:22.666 --> 00:09:24.257
You have my permission.

00:09:24.316 --> 00:09:26.328
Do you want to see Lolita?

00:09:26.387 --> 00:09:27.908
I think I must.

00:09:27.968 --> 00:09:30.149
Answers Don Diego.

00:09:30.209 --> 00:09:34.681
Don Carlos calls her and she comes to the patio.

00:09:34.741 --> 00:09:40.130
Lolita is a lovely girl with long black hair and dark eyes.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:41.848
Good morning, Senorita.

00:09:41.908 --> 00:09:43.890
There is something I must tell you.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.042
Says Don Diego smiling.

00:09:46.102 --> 00:09:49.414
I want to marry you, and your father approves.

00:09:49.474 --> 00:09:50.956
Oh, Senor.

00:09:51.016 --> 00:09:52.427
Exclaims Lolita.

00:09:52.487 --> 00:09:54.088
You want to marry me?

00:09:54.148 --> 00:09:57.612
She is surprised, and her face is red.

00:09:57.672 --> 00:09:59.444
Think about it today.

00:09:59.504 --> 00:10:02.716
One of my servants can bring me your answer tomorrow.

00:10:02.776 --> 00:10:04.884
But why can't you come tomorrow?

00:10:04.944 --> 00:10:06.502
Ask slowly.

00:10:06.562 --> 00:10:08.854
Oh, your hussy end is far.

00:10:08.914 --> 00:10:11.217
I get tired when I ride my horse.

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:13.709
I prefer to stay at home and rest.

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:15.010
What?

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:19.334
You want to marry me and you don't want to visit me?

00:10:19.394 --> 00:10:22.086
Is this your idea of love?

00:10:22.146 --> 00:10:26.020
I want to marry a strong romantic man.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:30.814
You are young and rich, but you are not strong or romantic.

00:10:30.874 --> 00:10:32.436
Do you have a heart?"

00:10:32.496 --> 00:10:33.888
says Lolita.

00:10:33.948 --> 00:10:35.369
She is angry.

00:10:35.429 --> 00:10:38.574
She runs away and tells her mother.

00:10:38.634 --> 00:10:42.930
Donna Catalina says, You are lucky Lolita.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.742
Don Diego is very rich.

00:10:45.802 --> 00:10:48.545
He comes from a noble family.

00:10:48.605 --> 00:10:51.068
The governor likes his family.

00:10:51.127 --> 00:10:54.631
This is a big opportunity for our family.

00:10:54.691 --> 00:10:58.826
In the afternoon, Lolita is alone in the patio.

00:10:58.886 --> 00:11:01.602
She is thinking about Don Diego.

00:11:01.662 --> 00:11:05.780
Suddenly, she hears a noise and turns around.

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:09.031
She sees Zorro standing in front of her.

00:11:09.092 --> 00:11:10.182
Zorro!

00:11:10.243 --> 00:11:11.323
She whispers.

00:11:11.383 --> 00:11:13.374
Don't be afraid, Senorita.

00:11:13.434 --> 00:11:15.656
I only punish corrupt people.

00:11:15.716 --> 00:11:18.008
I like your father because he is honest.

00:11:18.068 --> 00:11:20.339
I'm here to admire your beauty.

00:11:20.399 --> 00:11:21.290
What?

00:11:21.350 --> 00:11:23.251
You must go away.

00:11:23.311 --> 00:11:25.102
You are in great danger.

00:11:25.162 --> 00:11:26.865
Says Lolita.

00:11:26.925 --> 00:11:30.568
You are beautiful and kind, Lolita, says Zoro.

00:11:30.628 --> 00:11:32.198
Let me kiss your hand.

00:11:32.258 --> 00:11:36.100
Zoro takes her small hand and kisses it.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:40.532
Lolita looks into his eyes and smiles.

00:11:40.592 --> 00:11:43.042
Then she runs into the house.

00:11:43.102 --> 00:11:45.613
What a courageous man.

00:11:45.674 --> 00:11:48.884
He is a bandit, but I like him.

00:11:48.944 --> 00:11:51.654
Lolita thinks.

00:11:51.714 --> 00:12:01.428
Spanish California, read this page from a Spanish friars diary and learn about Spanish California.

00:12:01.488 --> 00:12:07.410
San Diego de Alcala, April 22, 1802.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:10.602
California is a beautiful place.

00:12:10.662 --> 00:12:13.244
It is always warm and sunny.

00:12:13.304 --> 00:12:16.926
There are flowers and fruit trees everywhere.

00:12:16.986 --> 00:12:20.814
I live in the San Diego de Alcala Mission.

00:12:20.874 --> 00:12:23.521
Other friars live here too.

00:12:23.581 --> 00:12:28.486
San Diego de Alcala is the first Californian mission.

00:12:28.546 --> 00:12:32.158
Many Indians live in the village near the mission.

00:12:32.218 --> 00:12:33.960
They are friendly.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.492
We teach them many things.

00:12:36.552 --> 00:12:39.414
Spanish families live here too.

00:12:39.474 --> 00:12:43.408
Some rich families have big haciendas.

00:12:43.468 --> 00:12:48.646
The village of San Diego de Alcala is growing quickly.

00:12:48.706 --> 00:12:51.760
It is near the Pacific Ocean.

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:56.690
Spanish ships often come and bring things from Spain.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.481
Some villages have military presidios.

00:13:00.541 --> 00:13:04.442
Spanish soldiers live in the presidios.

00:13:04.502 --> 00:13:09.423
Today, Friar Junipero Serra is visiting us.

00:13:09.483 --> 00:13:12.263
He is a very important friar.

00:13:12.323 --> 00:13:16.132
He travels and builds missions in California.

00:13:16.192 --> 00:13:19.820
He wants to build 21 missions.

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:37.148
Some big missions in California are San Juan Capistrano, Reina de Los Angeles, Santa Barbara, San Luis Obispo, Carmel, San Francisco.

00:13:37.208 --> 00:13:43.292
Chapter 4, Captain Ramon.

00:13:43.352 --> 00:13:48.877
At 8 p.m., it is dinner time at Don Carlos's home.

00:13:48.937 --> 00:13:51.628
The family is sitting at the table.

00:13:51.688 --> 00:13:54.690
Someone knocks at the door.

00:13:54.750 --> 00:14:01.257
A servant opens it, and Zorro appears.

00:14:01.317 --> 00:14:05.014
Don Carlos, his wife and daughter stand up.

00:14:05.074 --> 00:14:06.754
They are scared.

00:14:06.814 --> 00:14:08.965
Good evening, says Zorro.

00:14:09.025 --> 00:14:10.416
Don't be scared.

00:14:10.476 --> 00:14:13.207
You are an honest man, Don Carlos.

00:14:13.267 --> 00:14:15.588
I only want some food and drink.

00:14:15.648 --> 00:14:19.000
Zorro goes to Lolita and whispers.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:22.291
I cannot forget this afternoon in the patio.

00:14:22.351 --> 00:14:24.182
You must not come here.

00:14:24.242 --> 00:14:25.502
It is dangerous.

00:14:25.562 --> 00:14:27.378
Whispers Lolita.

00:14:27.438 --> 00:14:31.647
Suddenly a young Spanish soldier enters the house.

00:14:31.706 --> 00:14:33.968
He is Captain Ramon.

00:14:34.028 --> 00:14:36.530
He wants to arrest Zorro.

00:14:36.590 --> 00:14:40.053
Zorro takes out his sword and they fight.

00:14:40.113 --> 00:14:43.076
The two men are good fighters.

00:14:43.136 --> 00:14:45.497
I want to arrest you, Zorro.

00:14:45.557 --> 00:14:47.048
Says Captain Ramon.

00:14:47.108 --> 00:14:48.710
You are a public enemy.

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:50.161
You cannot arrest me.

00:14:50.221 --> 00:14:51.552
Says Zorro.

00:14:51.612 --> 00:14:56.666
Zorro injures the Captain's shoulder with his sword.

00:14:56.726 --> 00:15:00.009
The captain falls to the floor.

00:15:00.069 --> 00:15:01.780
Please help the captain.

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.211
Zorro says to Don Carlos.

00:15:04.271 --> 00:15:10.804
Then he smiles at Lolita and rides away on his horse.

00:15:10.864 --> 00:15:18.267
Don Carlos' wife and daughter look after Captain Ramon's injured shoulder.

00:15:18.327 --> 00:15:21.718
The captain likes beautiful Lolita.

00:15:21.778 --> 00:15:24.850
Don Carlos says the captain.

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:27.102
I like Lolita very much.

00:15:27.162 --> 00:15:31.476
I come from a good family, and I am the governor's friend.

00:15:31.536 --> 00:15:35.849
I'm 23 years old, and I am the captain of the Placidio.

00:15:35.909 --> 00:15:38.311
May I court Lolita.

00:15:38.371 --> 00:15:41.364
First, I must explain something.

00:15:41.424 --> 00:15:42.954
Says Don Carlos.

00:15:43.014 --> 00:15:46.958
Don Diego Vega wants to court Lolita too.

00:15:47.018 --> 00:15:53.355
Lolita must choose her husband herself, but you have my permission to court her.

00:15:53.415 --> 00:15:58.278
The next morning, there is a lot of noise at the Presidio.

00:15:58.338 --> 00:16:01.749
Don Diego and other men are watching.

00:16:01.809 --> 00:16:04.720
There are many soldiers on their horses.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:08.941
They are listening to Sergeant Gonzales.

00:16:09.001 --> 00:16:12.422
Today is an important day.

00:16:12.482 --> 00:16:14.673
We must find Zorro.

00:16:14.733 --> 00:16:19.284
We must look in every Hacienda and in every home.

00:16:19.344 --> 00:16:21.945
Remember the governor's big reward.

00:16:22.005 --> 00:16:23.409
Let's go!

00:16:23.469 --> 00:16:28.474
That morning, Don Diego sends a letter to Don Cados.

00:16:28.534 --> 00:16:34.565
My dear friend, Sergeant Gonzales and his soldiers want to arrest Zorro.

00:16:34.625 --> 00:16:38.716
It is dangerous for you and your family to stay at your Hacienda.

00:16:38.776 --> 00:16:42.556
Please come to my home in Reina de Los Angeles.

00:16:42.616 --> 00:16:44.377
It is safe in my home.

00:16:44.436 --> 00:16:46.637
I must go away for a few days.

00:16:46.697 --> 00:16:49.467
Your friend, Diego Vega.

00:16:49.527 --> 00:16:55.164
Don Cados receives the letter and says, What a generous invitation!

00:16:55.224 --> 00:16:57.836
Don Diego wants to protect Lolita.

00:16:57.896 --> 00:17:00.077
We must accept the invitation.

00:17:00.137 --> 00:17:03.749
Let us go immediately.

00:17:03.809 --> 00:17:09.632
Chapter 5 Lolita is in love.

00:17:09.692 --> 00:17:15.556
Don Diego's home in Reina de Los Angeles is big and beautiful.

00:17:15.616 --> 00:17:18.898
There are many rooms and many servants.

00:17:18.958 --> 00:17:22.688
There is a big garden with trees and flowers.

00:17:22.748 --> 00:17:26.016
Don Carlos and his family like it.

00:17:26.077 --> 00:17:32.109
Lolita, Mary Don Diego and this beautiful home is yours.

00:17:32.169 --> 00:17:33.724
Says Donna Catalina.

00:17:33.784 --> 00:17:35.698
I don't love Don Diego.

00:17:35.758 --> 00:17:37.389
I don't want to marry him.

00:17:37.449 --> 00:17:38.569
Says Lolita.

00:17:38.629 --> 00:17:43.360
Lolita, tonight your mother and I must visit our old friends.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:44.980
Says Don Carlos.

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:46.890
Can you stay at home alone?

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:48.631
Yes, of course.

00:17:48.691 --> 00:17:52.001
There are many books in Don Diego's library.

00:17:52.062 --> 00:17:54.342
I can stay here and read.

00:17:54.402 --> 00:17:56.972
Lolita looks at the books.

00:17:57.032 --> 00:17:58.943
How strange.

00:17:59.003 --> 00:17:59.893
She thinks.

00:17:59.953 --> 00:18:08.880
Don Diego has books about love, passion, adventure, horses, and heroes, but he isn't strong.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:11.042
It is so lifeless.

00:18:11.102 --> 00:18:14.704
Suddenly there is a knock at the door.

00:18:14.764 --> 00:18:21.120
A servant opens it, and Captain Ramon enters.

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:24.817
He goes to the library and sees Lolita.

00:18:24.877 --> 00:18:27.082
I'm glad you are alone.

00:18:27.142 --> 00:18:29.693
You are a very beautiful girl.

00:18:29.753 --> 00:18:32.533
I have your father's permission to court you.

00:18:32.593 --> 00:18:38.374
I know that Don Diego wants to marry you, but I am superior in every way.

00:18:38.434 --> 00:18:40.885
Don Diego has no courage.

00:18:40.945 --> 00:18:42.815
He is a weak man.

00:18:42.875 --> 00:18:46.156
I am the captain of the Presidio.

00:18:46.216 --> 00:18:48.986
I am alone, says Lolita.

00:18:49.046 --> 00:18:50.736
You cannot stay here.

00:18:50.797 --> 00:18:52.227
It is not right.

00:18:52.287 --> 00:18:53.772
Please go away.

00:18:53.832 --> 00:18:58.970
Captain Ramon takes her hand and says, don't run away Lolita.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:00.541
You are mine.

00:19:00.601 --> 00:19:02.342
Kiss me.

00:19:02.402 --> 00:19:07.445
Lolita pushes him away and says, I don't want to kiss you.

00:19:07.505 --> 00:19:09.006
Go away.

00:19:09.066 --> 00:19:11.187
No, you are mine.

00:19:11.247 --> 00:19:13.048
You must marry me.

00:19:13.108 --> 00:19:15.430
Now kiss me.

00:19:15.490 --> 00:19:19.369
Lolita slaps the captain's face.

00:19:19.429 --> 00:19:27.310
At that moment, Zorro appears in the library and says, Captain Ramon, you are a villain.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.160
Don't touch Lolita.

00:19:29.221 --> 00:19:31.562
Leave this house immediately.

00:19:31.622 --> 00:19:36.654
I cannot forget this terrible insult, says the captain.

00:19:36.714 --> 00:19:38.936
His face is red with anger.

00:19:38.996 --> 00:19:44.504
Zorro opens the door and kicks him out.

00:19:44.564 --> 00:19:47.290
Thank you for your help, Zorro.

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:50.192
You are courageous and kind.

00:19:50.252 --> 00:19:51.813
I love you."

00:19:51.873 --> 00:19:53.324
Lolita says.

00:19:53.384 --> 00:19:57.586
Dear Lolita, I love you too, says Zorro.

00:19:57.646 --> 00:20:04.938
They embrace and kiss.

00:20:04.998 --> 00:20:12.820
Captain Ramon returns to the Presidio.

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.872
He is furious.

00:20:14.932 --> 00:20:20.947
I must punish Lolita, her family and Zoro for their insults.

00:20:21.007 --> 00:20:24.600
He thinks, I must write a letter to the governor.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:30.354
I must tell him that Don Carlos Pulido and his family are traitors.

00:20:30.414 --> 00:20:32.186
They are Zoro's friends.

00:20:32.246 --> 00:20:34.502
They help him.

00:20:34.562 --> 00:20:38.488
He writes the letter and sends it to the governor.

00:20:38.548 --> 00:20:45.490
He smiles and says, I want to see the Pulido family in prison.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.270
I want to see you in prison.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:50.281
Says a man's voice.

00:20:50.341 --> 00:20:54.282
Captain Ramon turns around and sees Zorro.

00:20:54.342 --> 00:20:55.662
You are a villain.

00:20:55.722 --> 00:20:58.563
Fight me, but don't hurt the Pulido family.

00:20:58.623 --> 00:21:00.186
Says Zorro.

00:21:00.246 --> 00:21:04.352
Sergeant Gonzalez, come quickly, says the captain.

00:21:04.412 --> 00:21:06.042
Zorro is here.

00:21:06.102 --> 00:21:08.154
Zorro disappears.

00:21:08.214 --> 00:21:09.724
I am here, Captain.

00:21:09.784 --> 00:21:11.746
Says Sergeant Gonzalez.

00:21:11.806 --> 00:21:15.007
Take all the soldiers and find Zorro.

00:21:15.067 --> 00:21:16.958
We must capture him.

00:21:17.019 --> 00:21:19.660
The soldiers follow Zorro.

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:21.510
The night is dark.

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:26.313
It is difficult to follow him because his horse is very fast.

00:21:26.373 --> 00:21:31.174
The next morning, the soldiers return to the Presidio.

00:21:31.234 --> 00:21:34.344
They are tired and angry.

00:21:34.404 --> 00:21:37.136
Zorro is still free.

00:21:37.196 --> 00:21:41.370
There are many people in front of the Presidio that morning.

00:21:41.430 --> 00:21:44.021
Don Diego is there too.

00:21:44.082 --> 00:21:47.124
Something is happening.

00:21:47.184 --> 00:21:52.218
An old friar is standing before the magistrate.

00:21:52.278 --> 00:21:56.774
The old friar is in chains.

00:21:56.834 --> 00:21:59.819
I am not a thief.

00:21:59.879 --> 00:22:01.400
Says the old friar.

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.131
I am a poor friar.

00:22:03.191 --> 00:22:04.862
What is happening?

00:22:04.922 --> 00:22:06.473
Asks Don Diego.

00:22:06.533 --> 00:22:08.864
This old friar is a thief.

00:22:08.924 --> 00:22:10.606
He must be punished.

00:22:10.666 --> 00:22:12.436
Answers the magistrate.

00:22:12.496 --> 00:22:14.478
That is impossible.

00:22:14.538 --> 00:22:17.130
Friar Felipe is an honest man.

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:18.360
I know him.

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:20.282
Says Don Diego.

00:22:20.342 --> 00:22:22.503
No, you are wrong.

00:22:22.563 --> 00:22:24.774
Says the cruel magistrate.

00:22:24.834 --> 00:22:31.458
He calls two soldiers and says, Whip this friar 15 times.

00:22:31.518 --> 00:22:36.970
The soldiers whip the old friar and he falls to the ground.

00:22:37.030 --> 00:22:42.943
Don Diego is very angry because friar Felipe is his friend.

00:22:43.004 --> 00:22:46.286
He returns to his father's hacienda.

00:22:46.346 --> 00:22:48.396
Good afternoon, my son.

00:22:48.456 --> 00:22:51.428
Says his father, Don Alejandro Vega.

00:22:51.488 --> 00:22:53.500
I am happy to see you.

00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:55.952
Come and tell me about Lolita.

00:22:56.012 --> 00:22:58.104
Does she want to marry you?

00:22:58.164 --> 00:23:01.817
I like Lolita, but she doesn't like me.

00:23:01.878 --> 00:23:04.010
She likes romantic men.

00:23:04.070 --> 00:23:05.470
What can I do?

00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:07.092
Ask Ston Diego.

00:23:07.152 --> 00:23:10.236
Girls like courageous romantic men.

00:23:10.296 --> 00:23:12.247
You must talk about love.

00:23:12.307 --> 00:23:15.620
You must play the guitar and sing love songs.

00:23:15.680 --> 00:23:17.398
Give her some flowers.

00:23:17.458 --> 00:23:19.436
This is what young men do.

00:23:19.496 --> 00:23:20.888
Wake up Diego.

00:23:20.948 --> 00:23:22.559
Says Don Alejandro.

00:23:22.619 --> 00:23:24.260
How ridiculous.

00:23:24.320 --> 00:23:26.672
I cannot do these stupid things.

00:23:26.732 --> 00:23:28.064
Says Don Diego.

00:23:28.124 --> 00:23:29.454
You must try.

00:23:29.514 --> 00:23:31.346
Lolita's a lovely girl.

00:23:31.406 --> 00:23:32.928
Says Don Alejandro.

00:23:32.988 --> 00:23:35.490
There are many problems in my life.

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:37.781
I want to rest and meditate.

00:23:37.842 --> 00:23:41.284
Says Don Diego.

00:23:41.345 --> 00:23:44.768
Chapter 7.

00:23:44.828 --> 00:23:47.357
The Avengers.

00:23:47.417 --> 00:23:52.487
In the evening, the magistrate and his friends are in the tavern.

00:23:52.547 --> 00:23:57.820
They are laughing about the old friar.

00:23:57.880 --> 00:24:01.912
Why are you laughing?

00:24:01.972 --> 00:24:04.352
asks a mysterious voice.

00:24:04.413 --> 00:24:09.178
They look at the door of the tavern and see Zorro.

00:24:09.238 --> 00:24:13.324
He has a pistol in one hand and a sword in the other.

00:24:13.384 --> 00:24:17.860
Magistrate, I'm here to punish you, says Zorro.

00:24:17.920 --> 00:24:21.769
Old friar Felipe is not a thief and you know it.

00:24:21.830 --> 00:24:24.535
I am an important magistrate.

00:24:24.595 --> 00:24:29.716
I don't like friars because they are your friends, Zorro.

00:24:29.776 --> 00:24:38.158
Zorro gives a whip to the magistrate's friend and says, Now whip this corrupt magistrate fifteen times.

00:24:38.218 --> 00:24:41.068
But I cannot do this, says the friend.

00:24:41.128 --> 00:24:44.469
Whip him or I whip you, says Zorro.

00:24:44.529 --> 00:24:47.529
The friend whips the magistrate.

00:24:47.589 --> 00:24:51.949
After the punishment, the magistrate falls to the ground.

00:24:52.009 --> 00:24:56.250
This is how I punish dishonest people," says Zorro.

00:24:56.310 --> 00:25:00.921
The next day, everyone talks about the magistrate's punishment.

00:25:00.981 --> 00:25:06.643
A group of young men want to help Captain Ramon arrest Zorro.

00:25:06.703 --> 00:25:10.785
They look for him in the hills and in the valleys.

00:25:10.845 --> 00:25:14.746
In the evening, they go to the Vega Hacienda.

00:25:14.806 --> 00:25:19.894
When Don Alejandro sees them, he says, why are you all here?

00:25:19.954 --> 00:25:21.730
We are looking for Zorro.

00:25:21.790 --> 00:25:24.611
We want to capture the Bandit and get the reward.

00:25:24.671 --> 00:25:26.611
But now we are tired and hungry.

00:25:26.671 --> 00:25:28.292
Can you give us some food?

00:25:28.352 --> 00:25:29.672
Yes, of course.

00:25:29.732 --> 00:25:30.902
Please come in.

00:25:30.962 --> 00:25:33.903
You can put your swords and pistols near the door.

00:25:33.963 --> 00:25:35.453
Says Don Alejandro.

00:25:35.513 --> 00:25:36.594
Sit down.

00:25:36.654 --> 00:25:39.514
Eat these cakes and drink this wine.

00:25:39.574 --> 00:25:44.330
Don Alejandro and Don Diego talk to the young men.

00:25:44.390 --> 00:25:47.345
At 9 p.m., Don Diego says.

00:25:47.405 --> 00:25:49.076
Please excuse me.

00:25:49.136 --> 00:25:52.176
I am tired, and I'm going to bed.

00:25:52.236 --> 00:25:53.607
Look, Diego.

00:25:53.667 --> 00:25:55.538
These young men are not tired.

00:25:55.598 --> 00:25:57.518
It's only 9 p.m.

00:25:57.578 --> 00:26:00.630
You are young, but you are always tired.

00:26:00.690 --> 00:26:02.650
Says Don Alejandro.

00:26:02.710 --> 00:26:04.081
Yes, Father.

00:26:04.141 --> 00:26:05.391
You are right.

00:26:05.451 --> 00:26:07.362
Good night, everyone.

00:26:07.422 --> 00:26:11.269
The others eat, drink, and sing.

00:26:11.330 --> 00:26:15.771
At midnight, a masked man appears at the door.

00:26:15.831 --> 00:26:17.002
Look!

00:26:17.062 --> 00:26:18.454
It is Zorro!

00:26:18.514 --> 00:26:20.488
Says one of the young men.

00:26:20.548 --> 00:26:22.796
Zorro the Bandit!

00:26:22.856 --> 00:26:24.725
They all say.

00:26:24.785 --> 00:26:28.688
Yes, I am Zorro, but I am not a bandit.

00:26:28.748 --> 00:26:31.821
I have principles, and I fight for them.

00:26:31.881 --> 00:26:38.106
In California we have corrupt political men, cruel magistrates, and dishonest people.

00:26:38.166 --> 00:26:40.078
I want to change this.

00:26:40.138 --> 00:26:44.322
I fight to help the poor, the natives, and the friars.

00:26:44.382 --> 00:26:46.463
What are your principles?

00:26:46.524 --> 00:26:50.086
We want to help the poor, the natives and the friars too!

00:26:50.146 --> 00:26:52.103
Says one young man.

00:26:52.163 --> 00:26:54.579
Our principles are the same.

00:26:54.639 --> 00:26:55.859
Says another.

00:26:55.919 --> 00:26:58.870
Come with me and we can fight together.

00:26:58.930 --> 00:27:01.742
We can make California a better place to live.

00:27:01.802 --> 00:27:03.012
Says Zorro.

00:27:03.072 --> 00:27:04.853
But who are you?

00:27:04.913 --> 00:27:06.154
Where do you live?

00:27:06.214 --> 00:27:07.824
Asks a young man.

00:27:07.884 --> 00:27:09.425
I can't tell you.

00:27:09.485 --> 00:27:10.505
It's a secret.

00:27:10.565 --> 00:27:11.706
Says Zorro.

00:27:11.766 --> 00:27:14.537
The young men talk together.

00:27:14.597 --> 00:27:16.818
Yes, we want to fight with you.

00:27:16.878 --> 00:27:18.908
We want justice in California.

00:27:18.968 --> 00:27:21.220
Our new name is The Avengers.

00:27:21.279 --> 00:27:22.448
Says a young man.

00:27:22.508 --> 00:27:26.526
Yes, the Avengers, they all say.

00:27:26.586 --> 00:27:29.548
Good, we now fight together.

00:27:29.608 --> 00:27:32.508
Cesaro, and leaves.

00:27:32.568 --> 00:27:35.180
California today.

00:27:35.240 --> 00:27:40.392
California is an important state of the United States.

00:27:40.452 --> 00:27:44.043
About 34 million people live there.

00:27:44.103 --> 00:27:49.480
Many old Spanish missions are now important cities and towns.

00:27:49.540 --> 00:27:53.088
Many people in California speak Spanish.

00:27:53.148 --> 00:28:00.304
Towns, streets, parks, schools, and other places often have Spanish names.

00:28:00.364 --> 00:28:04.316
The capital of California is Sacramento.

00:28:04.376 --> 00:28:08.390
California is famous for its natural beauty.

00:28:08.450 --> 00:28:16.657
There are tall mountains, green valleys, forests, sandy beaches, and hot deserts.

00:28:16.717 --> 00:28:30.464
Some beautiful national parks are Yosemite, Sequoia, Kings Canyon, Muir Woods, Shasta, Death Valley, and Humboldt Redwoods.

00:28:30.524 --> 00:28:35.496
Young people like Disneyland and the Great America theme park.

00:28:35.556 --> 00:28:39.960
Millions of tourists visit California every year.

00:28:40.020 --> 00:28:43.844
There are a lot of interesting places to visit.

00:28:43.904 --> 00:28:51.784
The University of California, Berkeley and Stanford University are two excellent universities.

00:28:51.844 --> 00:28:55.426
California is a cosmopolitan state.

00:28:55.486 --> 00:29:00.250
People from all over the world live there.

00:29:00.310 --> 00:29:05.674
Chapter eight, the escape.

00:29:05.734 --> 00:29:09.116
The governor of California is here today.

00:29:09.176 --> 00:29:11.758
Says Sergeant Gonzales.

00:29:11.818 --> 00:29:16.481
Says Captain Ramon, I must speak to him.

00:29:16.540 --> 00:29:18.712
Good morning, Captain Ramon.

00:29:18.772 --> 00:29:20.122
Says the Governor.

00:29:20.182 --> 00:29:21.884
I have your letter.

00:29:21.944 --> 00:29:25.886
Thank you for the information about the Pulido family.

00:29:25.946 --> 00:29:28.017
They are Zorro's friends.

00:29:28.077 --> 00:29:29.728
They are traitors.

00:29:29.788 --> 00:29:33.310
We must put them in prison and kill them.

00:29:33.370 --> 00:29:35.021
They are dangerous.

00:29:35.081 --> 00:29:37.322
What a good idea.

00:29:37.382 --> 00:29:40.014
My soldiers can arrest them today.

00:29:40.074 --> 00:29:41.666
Says the Captain.

00:29:41.726 --> 00:29:47.112
A group of soldiers goes to the Pulido Hacienda.

00:29:47.172 --> 00:29:53.538
They arrest Don Carlos, Dona Catalina, and Lolita.

00:29:53.598 --> 00:29:55.621
They take them to prison.

00:29:55.681 --> 00:29:57.964
Don Carlos is furious.

00:29:58.024 --> 00:30:02.239
His wife and daughter cry.

00:30:02.299 --> 00:30:08.614
When Don Diego hears about this, he goes to the governor.

00:30:08.674 --> 00:30:10.195
He asks him.

00:30:10.255 --> 00:30:13.026
Why is the Polito family in prison?

00:30:13.086 --> 00:30:14.967
The governor answers.

00:30:15.027 --> 00:30:17.098
They are Zorro's friends.

00:30:17.158 --> 00:30:18.939
They help and protect him.

00:30:18.999 --> 00:30:20.690
They are traitors.

00:30:20.750 --> 00:30:22.750
I cannot believe this.

00:30:22.810 --> 00:30:24.212
I know them.

00:30:24.272 --> 00:30:26.142
They are honest people.

00:30:26.202 --> 00:30:28.113
They don't help bandits.

00:30:28.173 --> 00:30:29.717
Says Don Diego.

00:30:29.777 --> 00:30:32.032
You are wronged on Diego.

00:30:32.092 --> 00:30:33.963
They must be punished.

00:30:34.023 --> 00:30:37.035
The punishment for traitors is death.

00:30:37.095 --> 00:30:38.826
Says the governor.

00:30:38.886 --> 00:30:43.920
Early in the evening, Zorro sends a message to the Avengers.

00:30:43.980 --> 00:30:48.803
A message says, Meet me at midnight at the lake.

00:30:48.863 --> 00:30:51.074
Bring your swords and pistols.

00:30:51.134 --> 00:30:53.306
Pass the word to everyone.

00:30:53.366 --> 00:30:57.690
At midnight, Zorro and the Avengers meet at the lake.

00:30:57.750 --> 00:31:01.243
Every Avenger has a mask on his face.

00:31:01.304 --> 00:31:02.966
Zorro says...

00:31:03.026 --> 00:31:07.050
We are here to rescue Don Pulido and his family.

00:31:07.110 --> 00:31:09.283
They must escape from prison.

00:31:09.343 --> 00:31:10.945
They are innocent.

00:31:11.005 --> 00:31:12.858
We must be silent.

00:31:12.918 --> 00:31:15.153
Enter the prison and help them.

00:31:15.213 --> 00:31:19.299
Francisco, you take Don Carlos to the village of Pala.

00:31:19.360 --> 00:31:23.432
Jose, you take Dona Catalina to the Vega Hacienda.

00:31:23.492 --> 00:31:26.084
I want to take Lolita to Friar Felipe.

00:31:26.144 --> 00:31:28.796
They must hide for a few days.

00:31:28.856 --> 00:31:34.010
Zorro and the Avengers rescue the Pulido family.

00:31:34.070 --> 00:31:38.844
Don Carlos and Dona Catalina reach their destination.

00:31:38.904 --> 00:31:42.616
The soldiers follow Zorro and Lolita.

00:31:42.676 --> 00:31:46.286
Zorro's horse is very fast.

00:31:46.346 --> 00:31:51.476
Zorro and Lolita arrive at Friar Felipe's Hacienda.

00:31:51.536 --> 00:31:56.218
Zorro says, Can Lolita stay here with you for a few days?

00:31:56.278 --> 00:31:57.868
She is in danger.

00:31:57.928 --> 00:31:59.910
Yes, I can protect her.

00:31:59.970 --> 00:32:01.570
Says Friar Felipe.

00:32:01.630 --> 00:32:07.453
Zorro kisses Lolita and says, Always remember that I love you.

00:32:07.513 --> 00:32:12.080
Then he rides away on his horse.

00:32:12.140 --> 00:32:22.031
Chapter 9 The Man Behind the Mask The soldiers follow Zorro all night.

00:32:22.091 --> 00:32:25.122
They cannot capture him.

00:32:25.183 --> 00:32:30.696
The next night, Zorro silently enters the governor's home.

00:32:30.756 --> 00:32:35.288
He wants to talk to the governor and Captain Ramon.

00:32:35.348 --> 00:32:38.764
They are sitting near the fire.

00:32:38.824 --> 00:32:44.991
Zorro enters and says, Don't move and don't make a noise.

00:32:45.052 --> 00:32:46.882
I want to speak to you.

00:32:46.942 --> 00:32:51.204
He has a pistol in one hand and a sword in the other.

00:32:51.264 --> 00:32:54.096
Zorro, why are you here?

00:32:54.156 --> 00:32:55.834
asks the governor.

00:32:55.894 --> 00:32:59.743
You are here to die, says Captain Ramon.

00:32:59.803 --> 00:33:00.384
No.

00:33:00.444 --> 00:33:01.654
Answer Zorro.

00:33:01.714 --> 00:33:03.746
I am here to bring justice.

00:33:03.806 --> 00:33:05.938
I am here to learn the truth.

00:33:05.998 --> 00:33:09.311
Governor, you want to punch the Polito family.

00:33:09.371 --> 00:33:10.450
Why?

00:33:10.510 --> 00:33:12.228
They are traitors.

00:33:12.288 --> 00:33:14.188
They are your friends, Zorro.

00:33:14.248 --> 00:33:15.379
They help you.

00:33:15.439 --> 00:33:17.760
Your friends are my enemies."

00:33:17.820 --> 00:33:19.060
Says the governor.

00:33:19.120 --> 00:33:20.661
They are not traitors.

00:33:20.721 --> 00:33:22.271
They do not help me.

00:33:22.331 --> 00:33:24.212
They are not my friends.

00:33:24.272 --> 00:33:26.783
He says, look at this letter.

00:33:26.843 --> 00:33:28.274
It accuses them.

00:33:28.334 --> 00:33:29.824
Says the governor.

00:33:29.884 --> 00:33:34.976
Zorro reads the letter and says, it is Captain Ramon's letter.

00:33:35.036 --> 00:33:37.387
He accuses the Polito family.

00:33:37.447 --> 00:33:44.685
Zorro looks at the captain and says, Captain, you are a liar, but I am here to punish you.

00:33:44.745 --> 00:33:48.348
Tell the Governor the truth about the Polito family.

00:33:48.408 --> 00:33:57.003
Zorro puts his pistol to Captain Ramon's head and says, Tell the Governor the truth or I shoot.

00:33:57.063 --> 00:33:59.724
Captain Ramon is silent.

00:33:59.784 --> 00:34:01.476
His face is white.

00:34:01.536 --> 00:34:03.627
Tell the truth you liar.

00:34:03.687 --> 00:34:05.028
Says Zorro.

00:34:05.088 --> 00:34:08.038
Yes, I am a liar.

00:34:08.098 --> 00:34:10.738
The letter is not true.

00:34:10.798 --> 00:34:14.231
This is terrible, says the governor.

00:34:14.290 --> 00:34:15.532
You are a liar.

00:34:15.592 --> 00:34:18.874
You cannot be the captain of the Presidio.

00:34:18.934 --> 00:34:23.188
At that moment, the captain pulls out his sword.

00:34:23.248 --> 00:34:25.289
He begins to fight Zorro.

00:34:25.350 --> 00:34:27.572
It is a long sword fight.

00:34:27.632 --> 00:34:33.145
In the end, Zorro kills Captain Ramon.

00:34:33.206 --> 00:34:38.907
The captain is dead, says Zorro to the governor.

00:34:38.967 --> 00:34:42.745
Outside the governor's home, there are many soldiers.

00:34:42.805 --> 00:34:45.296
They want to capture Zorro.

00:34:45.356 --> 00:34:48.997
He sees Lolita on her horse.

00:34:49.057 --> 00:34:51.228
He shouts.

00:34:51.288 --> 00:34:53.298
Lolita, come with me.

00:34:53.358 --> 00:34:55.429
We must hide in the old tavern.

00:34:55.489 --> 00:34:57.860
This time it is very difficult to escape.

00:34:57.920 --> 00:35:00.070
There are soldiers all around us.

00:35:00.130 --> 00:35:02.381
I'm happy to be with you, Zorro.

00:35:02.441 --> 00:35:03.411
Says Lolita.

00:35:03.472 --> 00:35:05.145
I'm not scared.

00:35:05.206 --> 00:35:09.280
Zorro and Lolita hide inside the old tavern.

00:35:09.340 --> 00:35:11.572
The soldiers try to enter.

00:35:11.632 --> 00:35:14.172
Zorro is ready to fight.

00:35:14.232 --> 00:35:18.724
Suddenly the Avengers come to rescue Zorro and Lolita.

00:35:18.784 --> 00:35:21.966
They explain many things to the governor.

00:35:22.026 --> 00:35:25.037
The governor pardons Zorro.

00:35:25.097 --> 00:35:29.028
Zorro and Lolita walk out of the old tavern.

00:35:29.088 --> 00:35:30.709
They are free.

00:35:30.769 --> 00:35:34.810
Everyone is happy and cheers.

